#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`display` --- display driver"
msgstr ":mod:`display` --- driver del display"

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:7
msgid ""
"The :mod:`display` module exposes drivers for external displays that can be "
"attached to an OpenMV Cam. Four interfaces are supported:"
msgstr ""
"Il modulo :mod:`display` espone i driver per i display esterni che possono "
"essere collegati a una OpenMV Cam. Sono supportate quattro interfacce:"

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:10
msgid ""
"SPI-attached TFTs (the smaller 16-bit displays such as the SSD1351), via "
":class:`SPIDisplay`."
msgstr ""
"TFT collegati via SPI (i display a 16 bit piu piccoli come l'SSD1351), "
"tramite :class:`SPIDisplay`\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:12
msgid ""
"24-bit parallel RGB panels driven by the LTDC/LCD-TFT controller, via "
":class:`RGBDisplay`. The same parallel bus also feeds external HDMI / "
"DisplayPort converters (e.g. a TFP410), so HDMI and DisplayPort outputs are "
"configured through :class:`RGBDisplay` too."
msgstr ""
"Pannelli RGB paralleli a 24 bit pilotati dal controller LTDC/LCD-TFT, "
"tramite :class:`RGBDisplay`\\ . Lo stesso bus parallelo alimenta anche i "
"convertitori HDMI / DisplayPort esterni (ad es. un TFP410), quindi anche le "
"uscite HDMI e DisplayPort vengono configurate tramite :class:`RGBDisplay`\\ "
"."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:16
msgid "MIPI-DSI panels, via :class:`DSIDisplay`."
msgstr "Pannelli MIPI-DSI, tramite :class:`DSIDisplay`\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:17
msgid "NTSC analog video on the OpenMV TV shield, via :class:`TVDisplay`."
msgstr ""
"Video analogico NTSC sullo shield OpenMV TV, tramite :class:`TVDisplay`\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:19
msgid ""
"Panel-specific initialisation lives in dedicated controller classes "
"(:class:`SSD1351` for SPI panels, :class:`ST7701` for DSI panels) that are "
"passed to the display constructor through the ``controller`` argument. "
"Backlight brightness is driven by :class:`DACBacklight` or "
":class:`PWMBacklight`, hooked in via the ``backlight`` argument."
msgstr ""
"L'inizializzazione specifica del pannello risiede in apposite classi "
"controller (\\ :class:`SSD1351` per i pannelli SPI, :class:`ST7701` per i "
"pannelli DSI) che vengono passate al costruttore del display tramite "
"l'argomento ``controller``\\ . La luminosita della retroilluminazione viene "
"pilotata da :class:`DACBacklight` o :class:`PWMBacklight`\\ , agganciata "
"tramite l'argomento ``backlight``\\ ."

#: ../../library/omv.display.rst:25
msgid ""
"The constants below select the output frame size and are accepted as the "
"``framesize`` argument by every display class. Once constructed a display "
"object accepts :class:`image.Image` buffers via its ``write()`` method to "
"present a frame."
msgstr ""
"Le costanti seguenti selezionano la dimensione del frame di output e sono "
"accettate come argomento ``framesize`` da ogni classe di display. Una volta "
"costruito, un oggetto display accetta buffer :class:`image.Image` tramite il"
" suo metodo ``write()`` per presentare un frame."

